 hated, was shot dead. Maigret found the villagers a closed community, determined to pin the murder on the local school-master - because he was a Parisian - not one of them. Even the schoolboys wouldn't talk...<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;font-size:16.8px;line-height:normal;font-family:'Arial Black';color:rgb(38,38,38);background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\"><span class=\"s1\">Director: Betty Davies</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;font-size:16.8px;line-height:normal;font-family:'Arial Black';color:rgb(38,38,38);background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);min-height:23px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;font-size:16.8px;line-height:normal;font-family:'Arial Black';color:rgb(38,38,38);background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\"><span class=\"s1\">Jules Maigret: Maurice Denham</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;font-size:16.8px;line-height:normal;font-family:'Arial Black';color:rgb(38,38,38);background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\"><span class=\"s1\">Georges Simenon: Michael Gough</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;font-size:16.8px;line-height:normal;font-family:'Arial Black';color:rgb(38,38,38);background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\"><span class=\"s1\">Joseph Gastin: Michael Spice</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;font-size:16.8px;line-height:normal;font-family:'Arial Black';color:rgb(38,38,38);background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\"><span class=\"s1\">Madame Gastin: Madi Hedd</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;font-size:16.8px;line-height:normal;font-family:'Arial Black';color:rgb(38,38,38);background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\"><span class=\"s1\">Jean-Paul Gastin: Denise Bryer</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;font-size:16.8px;line-height:normal;font-family:'Arial Black';color:rgb(38,38,38);background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\"><span class=\"s1\">Insp Danielou: Geoffrey Collins</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;font-size:16.8px;line-height:normal;font-family:'Arial Black';color:rgb(38,38,38);background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\"><span class=\"s1\">Dr Bresselles: Ronald Herdman</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;font-size:16.8px;line-height:normal;font-family:'Arial Black';color:rgb(38,38,38);background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\"><span class=\"s1\">Louis: Michael Goldie</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;font-size:16.8px;line-height:normal;font-family:'Arial Black';color:rgb(38,38,38);background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\"><span class=\"s1\">Maria: Shirley Dixon<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;font-size:16.8px;line-height:normal;font-family:'Arial Black';color:rgb(38,38,38);background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\"><span class=\"s1\">Marcellin Rateau: Michael Harbour</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;font-size:16.8px;line-height:normal;font-family:'Arial Black';color:rgb(38,38,38);background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\"><span class=\"s1\">Marcel Sellier: Jean England</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;font-size:16.8px;line-height:normal;font-family:'Arial Black';color:rgb(38,38,38);background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\"><span class=\"s1\">Joseph Rateau: Rosemary Miller</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;font-size:16.8px;line-height:normal;font-family:'Arial Black';color:rgb(38,38,38);background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\"><span class=\"s1\">Ferdinand: Gavin Campbell</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;font-size:16.8px;line-height:normal;font-family:'Arial Black';color:rgb(38,38,38);background-color:rgba(255,255